    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are at home on the move, having traveled the lightning rail tracks and trade routes of the Couriers Guild. House Orien bridges continents and outpaces distance through the Mark of Passage.</p><p>Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to <strong>Dexterity</strong> or <strong>Constitution</strong>, and one is a free attribute boost.</p><p>You're trained in the <strong>Survival</strong> skill and the <strong>House Orien Lore</strong> skill. You gain the <strong>Terrain Expertise</strong> skill feat. You have access to Mark of Passage feats.</p>"
